{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a generational action-simulation game set in the rural summer of Japan, where you live out the fleeting life of a cicada.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this brief existence,<br>how will you live \u2014 and what will you leave behind?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful foes and claim victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fall short, yet pass your will to the next generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply wander the fields, embracing the summer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single cicada\u2019s story \u2014 fleeting, yet burning bright.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Mating System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even cicadas want to grow stronger.<br>In this game, you don\u2019t just level up \u2014 you pass on your power through <strong>mating</strong>.<br>Soar through a vast open field, find your ideal partner, and mate to create a stronger next generation!<br>Control your offspring, inherit powerful traits, and challenge the enemies your previous self couldn\u2019t beat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Vitality System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is limited. Life is fleeting.<br>Your cicada\u2019s <strong>vitality</strong> constantly decreases from the moment the game begins.<br>When it hits zero, your life comes to an end\u2026<br>That\u2019s why every second counts \u2014 who will you meet, how will you live, and what legacy will you leave?<br>To survive, you must pass on your life. A bittersweet yet powerful experience awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the peaceful countryside of Japan, in the middle of summer.<br>Paddy fields, tall grass, streams, rustling trees\u2014<br>Fly freely as a cicada and explore a living, breathing summer world.<br>From above, the scenery looks like a miniature diorama full of detail and charm.<br>Discover, collect, and feel the world through the eyes of a cicada in this unique open-world adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations are free to stream this game without prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description or elsewhere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that we are not responsible for any damages arising from the streaming of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings such as graphics quality, mouse sensitivity, and more from the Options menu.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"GameClear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/31fdc70fe6eb89435d11af8d8e16561f612c9879.jpg"},{"name":"Prosperity of Descendants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/8ad08cd37bb18a3932e395ede125d5b82d3e4daa.jpg"},{"name":"All Tasks Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/0a6ae32d9a780cd88bf493e018295ef76a7911a2.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Butterfly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/9e28f95275ee3d2c5cbd16b814b42e509a43f7db.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Beetle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/a9ae9c31e14cb6913cb2f813a1ec4dc6ad8d5a69.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Dragonfly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918410/58468a8f0f5dafee102639e28534c27275d3efe5.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918410?t=1759201222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918410?t=1759201222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/0e9d466faa7312e0e46aed17b2ad9883e8519c23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759201222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/0e9d466faa7312e0e46aed17b2ad9883e8519c23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759201222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a generational action-simulation game set in the rural summer of Japan, where you live out the fleeting life of a cicada.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/a90346d8055097b2c22a74ed63d08c20.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this brief existence,<br>how will you live \u2014 and what will you leave behind?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful foes and claim victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fall short, yet pass your will to the next generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply wander the fields, embracing the summer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single cicada\u2019s story \u2014 fleeting, yet burning bright.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.poster.avif?t=1759201222\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.webm?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918410/extras/e21bf2c7e96a91c49925ae2e948edea2.mp4?t=1759201222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Mating System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"